# Camera-roll fixtures. These are photos of real, identifiable riders and this
# repo is public — keep them local. The matte-lab harness reads fixtures/ off
# disk, so nothing here needs to be tracked for it to work. Stock/reference
# imagery already committed to fixtures/ is unaffected.
fixtures/IMG_*
# Reference/comparison mattes derived from those photos. These are full-colour
# subject cutouts, not binary masks, so they identify the rider just as the
# source photo does.
fixtures/truth/
